<title>USA: NYSE Unavailables -.</title>
<headline>NYSE Unavailables -.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said Tuesday that John Alden Financial Corp, American Radio Systems Corp, Coleman Co Inc and Fluor Corp were not available for after-hours trading for news.</p>
<p>The exchange said Nine West Group and Corimon SACA were also not available.</p>
